id:                     E1193
trigger_tool:           cmake|conan
phase:                  configuration
error_signature:        Unknown CMake command "find_dependency"|Unknown CMake command.*find_dependency
severity:               2
category:               build-system, cmake, packaging, testing
match_keywords:         CMakeFindDependencyMacro, find_dependency, package config, find_package CONFIG, Conan test_package, exported CMake target
title:                  导出的 CMake 包配置调用 find_dependency 前须包含宏定义模块
root_cause:             上游生成的 KDSoapWSDiscoveryClientConfig.cmake.in 直接调用 find_dependency，但没有 include(CMakeFindDependencyMacro)；当消费者只通过 find_package 加载此配置且调用方没有提前定义该宏时，CMake 将 find_dependency 当作未知命令并中止配置。
affected_scope:         安装后导出 Config.cmake 中调用 find_dependency、却没有显式包含 CMakeFindDependencyMacro 的 CMake 库项目。
verification_cmd:       grep -n 'find_dependency\\|CMakeFindDependencyMacro' KDSoapWSDiscoveryClientConfig.cmake.in; cmake -S test_package -B test_package/build
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           include-cmake-find-dependency-macro
rec_description:        在导出包配置模板中于第一个 find_dependency() 前加入 include(CMakeFindDependencyMacro)，再从独立 Conan consumer 调用 find_package(... CONFIG REQUIRED) 验证。
rec_command:            sed -i '/@PACKAGE_INIT@/a include(CMakeFindDependencyMacro)' KDSoapWSDiscoveryClientConfig.cmake.in
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-edit
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      consumer-preinclude
fallback_description:   仅作诊断时，可让消费者在 find_package 前包含 CMakeFindDependencyMacro；正式库包应修复其导出配置，避免把宏加载顺序责任转嫁给所有调用者。
fallback_command:       cmake -DCMAKE_PROJECT_INCLUDE=CMakeFindDependencyMacro.cmake -S consumer -B build
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          manual-edit
forbid_1_pattern:       skip.*test_package|return.*before.*find_package
forbid_1_reason:        跳过安装包消费者配置会漏掉导出 Config.cmake 中的宏顺序错误。
forbid_1_consequence:   Conan 包的本地构建可能通过，但下游第一次 find_package 时立即失败。
principles:               
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/E546-draft-KDSC.md
last_updated:           2026-10-11
source_event:           kdsoap-ws-discovery-client 0.4.0 Conan L1 失败：导出 Config.cmake 调用 find_dependency 时报告 Unknown CMake command
authors:
source_pr:
source_commit:
metrics_success_count:  1
metrics_fail_count:     1
metrics_confidence:     0.5
metrics_last_used:      2026-10-11
authors:               KDSC
